<p>Electronic City, Chandapura and Bommasandra sit one after another along Hosur Road, and their kitchens have a lot in common. Flats here were built in the same decades by similar developers, so kitchen sizes repeat. Most homes draw on borewells and tankers, so the water is hard. And the monsoon is just as humid at Hebbagodi as in Phase 1. This guide applies our <a href="/modular-kitchen/">modular kitchen design guide</a> to those conditions, so you can brief a designer, read a quotation and check the installation with confidence.</p>

