<h2>From measurement to first meal</h2>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><strong>Measure after plastering</strong>Walls, window, beams, gas and water inlets. In new flats, check the builder's tiles before deciding to keep them.</li>
  <li><strong>Agree a 3D design</strong>Fix the hob, sink, chimney and appliance positions; services depend on them.</li>
  <li><strong>Get an itemised quote</strong>Board grade and brand per cabinet group, finish, hardware brand, countertop, accessories, GST.</li>
  <li><strong>Finish services on site</strong>Plumbing, drain, gas, sockets and wall tiling before the cabinets arrive.</li>
  <li><strong>Factory production</strong>Two to three weeks. Visit the factory if it is nearby; Bommasandra and Chandapura are 10–15 minutes from Electronic City outside rush hour.</li>
  <li><strong>Install and snag</strong>Three to five days, then a snag list: hinge alignment, drawer closure, sealant around the sink, and the chimney duct.</li>
</ol>

